      "id": "seg:paragraph:return-value:0008:0001",
      "source": "An [`AVCaptureExternalDisplayConfigurator`](avcaptureexternaldisplayconfigurator.md) instance.",
      "ko": "[`AVCaptureExternalDisplayConfigurator`](avcaptureexternaldisplayconfigurator.md) 인스턴스입니다.",
